        "start": "2026-10-12T00:00:00Z",
        "title": "sbom-tools validation assessment — NTIA Minimum Elements",
        "uuid": "0425376f-7838-56c3-bec5-8f2873c006d7"
      },
      {
        "description": "Validation results for CISA 2026 Minimum Elements, derived only from the supplied SBOM.",
        "findings": [
          {
            "description": "Overall verdict for CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: 9 error(s), 3 warning(s), 0 informational finding(s).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "cisa2026-compliance",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements compliance roll-up",
            "uuid": "ea63db51-26f7-594c-8f33-436b55dadaf3"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] SBOM Author missing: no Person or Organization creator names the entity that created the SBOM data (tool-only creator lists do not satisfy the element — the author is the entity operating the tool, not the tool itself)",
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "e56bcb5d-e88a-55b1-95c6-aa5e316b1b87"
              }
            ],
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-author",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-AUTHOR",
            "uuid": "b1440af9-98f0-5678-81d0-0e70c39f7511"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] No SBOM Author Signature found in the document (CycloneDX JSF signature or SPDX 3 verifiedUsing signature); SPDX 2.x cannot express one in-document and detached signatures are invisible to this check",
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "fb2e8002-8c70-5a1b-b53b-40e48c26390d"
              }
            ],
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-signature",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-SIGNATURE",
            "uuid": "ee45aab2-0684-58e5-b9b9-c25b5bb895e7"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] SBOM Generation Context missing: no software lifecycle phase is declared (CycloneDX 1.5+ metadata.lifecycles, e.g. 'pre-build', 'build', 'post-build'; SPDX 2.x has no standard field)",
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "aa14f4ec-c005-5640-9006-0f8abb41de19"
              }
            ],
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-generation-context",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-GENERATION-CONTEXT",
            "uuid": "b9fb3bbf-979b-5c18-916f-35cebf29185d"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' names no producer (author/originator, manufacturer or supplier) and is not explicitly marked as of unknown provenance",
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "ddab5b0f-3d24-5b07-9705-9f302419db17"
              }
            ],
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-producer",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-PRODUCER",
            "uuid": "970ffdf1-4949-534e-92bc-42673d3a1337"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' has no machine-processable identifier (CPE or PURL are named by the element; SWHID/SWID also qualify)",
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "ac20ff1c-bdea-53a4-b911-0a83f4e884cf"
              }
            ],
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-identifier",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-IDENTIFIER",
            "uuid": "eed6d01e-4582-54b0-8427-9cfcb38707a7"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[CISA 2026\\] Component 'test-app' carries no cryptographic hash of the executable component artifact (explicitly indicate the value is unknown when the artifact is not available to the SBOM author)",
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "2ba41766-867a-5496-a544-82fcb3a87b1f"
              }
            ],
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-cisa2026-hash",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-CISA2026-HASH",
            "uuid": "04e7a2cc-0bd3-5688-bf31-95d8190f5fd3"
          },
          {
